{"lyrics":"[00:00.00] [Instrumental Intro]\n[Verse 1: Halsey]\n[00:14.44] Found you when your heart was broke\n[00:17.10] I filled your cup until it overflowed\n[00:20.76] Took it so far to keep you close (Keep you close)\n[00:25.14] I was afraid to leave you on your own\n[Pre-Chorus: Halsey, Halsey & Juice WRLD]\n[00:28.50] I said I'd catch you if you fall (Fall)\n[00:31.32] And if they laugh, then fuck 'em all (All)\n[00:34.70] And then I got you off your knees\n[00:36.66] Put you right back on your feet\n[00:38.42] Just so you could take advantage of me\n[Chorus: Halsey]\n[00:41.84] Tell me, how's it feel sittin' up there?\n[00:45.02] Feelin' so high, but too far away to hold me\n[00:48.58] You know I'm the one who put you up there\n[00:52.32] Name in the sky, does it ever get lonely?\n[00:55.64] Thinking you could live without me\n[00:59.14] Thinking you could live without me\n[01:02.90] Baby, I'm the one who put you up there\n[01:06.26] I don't know why (Yeah, I don't know why)\n[01:09.96] Thinking you could live without me\n[01:13.34] Live without me\n[01:15.20] Baby, I'm the one who put you up there\n[01:18.06] I don't know why (I don't know why, yeah, yeah)\n[Verse 2: Halsey]\n[01:24.78] Gave love 'bout a hundred tries (Hundred tries)\n[01:28.68] Just running from the demons in your mind\n[01:31.34] Then I took yours and made 'em mine (Mine)\n[01:35.60] I didn't notice 'cause my love was blind\n[Pre-Chorus: Halsey, Halsey & Juice WRLD]\n[01:39.12] I said I'd catch you if you fall (Fall)\n[01:41.78] And if they laugh, then fuck 'em all (All)\n[01:45.30] And then I got you off your knees\n[01:47.24] Put you right back on your feet\n[01:49.02] Just so you could take advantage of me\n[Chorus: Halsey]\n[01:52.38] Tell me, how's it feel sittin' up there?\n[01:55.66] Feelin' so high but too far away to hold me\n[01:59.18] You know I'm the one who put you up there\n[02:02.68] Name in the sky, does it ever get lonely?\n[02:06.20] Thinking you could live without me\n[02:09.72] Thinking you could live without me\n[02:12.58] Baby, I'm the one who put you up there\n[02:15.78] I don't know why (Yeah, I don't know why)\n[02:20.32] Thinking you could live without me\n[02:24.04] Live without me\n[02:24.74] Baby, I'm the one who put you up there\n[02:27.74] I don't know why, yeah\n[Verse 3: Juice WRLD]\n[02:34.22] I'm sad inside, but I know it's for the best, right?\n[02:37.74] You had to realize where you drew the line\n[02:41.16] I would cross the line a thousand times\n[02:44.78] You've got what I need, bae, I need your spotlight\n[02:48.50] Along the lines of social suicide, I refuse to die not by your side\n[02:54.88] So I'll take what I can from you, then I'll hide\n[02:58.96] And save the \"Lucid Dreams\" for another time\n[03:03.72] I still hate it when you're not there\n[03:06.86] I know I should, I know I should, but no, I don't care\n[03:11.10] I still hate it when you're not there\n[03:13.64] This life's not fair, took advantage of that\n[Chorus: Halsey]\n[03:19.44] Tell me, how's it feel sittin' up there?\n[03:44.94] Feelin' so high but too far away to hold me\n[03:46.48] You know I'm the one who put you up there\n[03:49.78] Name in the sky, does it ever get lonely?\n[03:52.92] Thinking you could live without me\n[03:58.88] Thinking you could live without me\n[04:02.38] Baby, I'm the one who put you up there\n[04:05.30] I don't know why (Yeah, I don't know why)\n[04:10.88] Thinking you could live without me\n[04:13.80] Live without me\n[04:19.34] Baby, I'm the one who put you up there\n[04:21.50] I don't know why, yeah\n[Verse 4: Juice WRLD]\n[04:25.22] It feels like I could live without you on the real\n[04:33.52] Lucid dreams in the crib, I can't sleep for shit\n[04:41.38] Without you I may be alright, I could live on the\n[?]\n[04:44.84] And I don't wanna\n[?]\n[05:00.02] Loving you\n[?]\n[05:00.42] But you make me feel,\n[?]\n[05:01.12] Doing Xans\n[?]\n[05:01.40] I don't know why but I think i could live without you","